                "Beyond standalone moderation models, production guardrail frameworks like NVIDIA NeMo Guardrails and Llama Guard implement programmable execution rails: 1. Input Rails: Inspect user queries for prompt injection, jailbreaks, and toxic categories before routing to the main foundation LLM. 2. Dialog Rails: Enforce predefined conversation state machines, preventing the model from deviating from authorized domain boundaries. 3. Output Rails: Scan generated responses for factual hallucinations, unsanctioned financial promises, or PII leakage, replacing toxic outputs with compliant fallback responses.",
